+**Formulas:**
+- Objective: $\min_x \frac{1}{2} x^T Q x + c^T x$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Hessian: $Q = A^T A$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Linear term: $c = -A^T b$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Constraint enforcement: $x_i = \text{clip}(x'_i, 0, 1)$ [S1, unofficial].
 
